                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very bare-bones, but still highly enjoyable point and click game.  As you might note from my play-time, it's not terribly long, but that's A-OK, as it ensures that it doesn't wear out its welcome!\r\n\r\nThe puzzles are fun and almost 100% free of galaxy-brain solutions, requiring only a bit of thought and/or exploration before solutions become clear.\r\n\r\nThere's a few occasions where objects can't be picked up before a certain time, which is very much a sore point for me, but I'm not sure if it was a bug both times, or that bane of P and C adventures, a clearly useful item that you simply can't put in your inventory until some arbitrary progression point is passed and now the hotspot is activated.\r\n\r\nStill, even that little kvetch can't ruin a very simple, yet still rather fun game.\r\n\r\nRecommended.",
